    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Lines/min by host and container",
      "description": "Which stream went quiet? The solid series are per-machine, per-container rates. The seven series on the right axis are the exact counts the seven silence rules evaluate — six hours for the two capture daemons, for the shipping agent's own stream and for the liquidations poller, twenty-six hours for the scheduled ops units and for the ops journal transport, three hours for the archive-pull success line. Their bar is one line: below it the rule fires, and it fires the moment it crosses, with no pending period. Those counts run into the hundreds on a healthy stream, so the bar sits close to the floor of the right axis and the signal to read is a series reaching that floor. Container names are not symmetric across machines — the archive-pull loop is `archive-pull` on the NAS and `zcrypto-archive-pull` on the ops machine — so a single container pick blanks one of them. The archive-pull success series carries no machine filter because that container name exists only on the NAS. A rate of zero and a stream that never existed draw identically here; the table beside this panel is what tells them apart.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "grafanacloud-logs"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 7,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-logs"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (host, container) (rate({host=~\"$host\", container=~\"$container\"}[5m])) * 60",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}} / {{container}}",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-logs"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (host) (count_over_time({host=\"zcrypto\", container=\"capture\", level=~\".+\"} [6h])) or on() vector(0)",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "dead-man · capture daemon, primary (6h)",
          "queryType": "range",
          "step": "1h"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-logs"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (host) (count_over_time({host=\"zcrypto-red\", container=\"capture\", level=~\".+\"} [6h])) or on() vector(0)",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "dead-man · capture daemon, secondary (6h)",
          "queryType": "range",
          "step": "1h"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
